			description: [
				"Welcome to the modpack! This guide contains important things you should know."
				"Click the green arrow at the bottom left of the opened panel to go to the next page."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPONDER AND EMI:&r"
				"Hold &2&nW&r while holding certain items to open a screen called &aPonder&r, which teaches you how that item works. "
				"Use &6EMI&r to view recipes and crafting recipes."
				""
				"it is highly reccomended to use both of these features to figure out how things work."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lResearch System:&r"
				"In the RESEARCH section of the quest book are Researches. You &nsubmit&r items to the quest, which in turn unlocks various items and recipes for you. Researches are mandatory for progression."
				"If you haven't unlocked something it shows a little lock icon and tells you the research required."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lVANILLA CHANGES:&r"
				"This modpack changes some core vanilla systems."
				""
				"Enchanting tables are removed."
				"Vanilla potion brewing is removed."
				"Villagers and villages do not generate."
				"Most surface structures have been removed."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lMULTIPLAYER:&r"
				"This modpack is meant to be played in singleplayer. Things may break if you play it on multiplayer."
